{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56149","headline":"七真赞 八 · 杜光庭","name":"七真赞 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竦身淩太清，超景逸紫霄。\n保无持法网，游玄极逍遥。\n万刼犹昨夜，千春如晨朝。\n巍峩荫云华，手攀宝林条。\n香烟自然生，玄阶与扶摇。\n灵幡顺风散，繁想凝滞时消。\n灭智弘大混，无爲爲清谣。\n（同前卷五二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}